{'symbol': 'EIX', 'date': '2022-08-25 16:05:00', 'title': 'EDISON INTERNATIONAL AND SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA EDISON DECLARE Q3 DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'ROSEMEAD, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF EDISON INTERNATIONAL (NYSE: EIX) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND OF $0.70 PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON OCTOBER 31, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON SEPTEMBER 30, 2022. THE EDISON INTERNATIONAL BOARD ALSO DECLARED THE FOLLOWING DIVIDENDS, PAYABLE SEPTEMBER 15, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON SEPTEMBER 1, 2022: A SEMI-ANNUAL DIVIDEND OF $26.875 PER SHARE ON THE 5.375% FIXED-RATE RESET CUMULATIVE PERPETUAL PREFERRED STOCK,'}